OL,12,G0215 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FLinden, who's 15, is at King's
OL,14,     Fafter cutting his leg backflipping
OL,15,     Foff a shed onto a trampoline. And
OL,16,     FAntony - who has smoked for 40
OL,17,     Fyears - has lost all feeling in
OL,18,     Fhis left leg.
